  "descriptions": {
    "terran": ["Green hills under a mild sun, settled late and still filling.", "A temperate world of river towns and long harvests.", "Farms to the horizon and a town at every ford."],
    "ocean": ["One sea and a thousand islands; everything arrives by hull.", "Storm coasts, deep harbours and families who count in tides.", "Floating towns that move with the fishing."],
    "arid": ["Red rock and wells that are guarded like vaults.", "Dry plateaus, caravan towns and a sky that never clouds.", "A hard world that pays in ore and patience."],
    "forge": ["Foundries that have not gone cold in a hundred years.", "A world of slag fields and shift bells.", "Ore comes down the wells and hulls go up them."],
    "frozen": ["Ice to the equator and warm lights under it.", "A cold world of deep vaults and long nights.", "Stations on the ice, and cities beneath."],
    "barren": ["Airless rock with a garrison on it and a reason for one.", "A dead world, kept for what lies under it.", "Domes on grey dust and a beacon for the lane."],
    "gas": ["A banded giant and the skimmers that work its clouds.", "Stations in high orbit over a world with no ground.", "Storms the size of worlds, and fuel for whoever dares them."],
    "belt": ["A shoal of broken rock and the claims staked across it.", "No world here, only a belt and the people who mine it.", "Ten thousand rocks, a hundred claims, one customs post."]
